<p>At Tour Varanasi, our <strong>five-day Varanasi and Ayodhya private tour starts from ₹22,000 per person</strong>, while our <strong>six-day Varanasi, Prayagraj and Ayodhya tour starts from ₹26,000 per person</strong>.</p>
<p>Both starting prices include GST and are based on a minimum of two guests. They cover the specified ground arrangements; <strong>hotels are quoted separately</strong>.</p>
<p>This guide explains the package costs and the choices that affect your final budget.</p>
