<h2>How many days should you allow?</h2>
<p>For a private journey focused on Varanasi and Ayodhya, our five-day programme provides a useful starting point.</p>
<p>For all three destinations, we suggest considering six days, especially when guests want time for the Sangam boat, temple visits and breaks between outings. Your actual sightseeing time will depend on when you arrive on the first day and depart on the last.</p>
<p>Senior travellers may prefer shorter sightseeing sessions and more time around hotel check-in and meals. A longer stay can also make room for Sarnath, neighbourhood walks or additional visits without packing every day too tightly.</p>
<p>We adjust the itinerary around the guests rather than treating the number of days as a fixed checklist.</p>
<h2>Planning a Kashi, Ayodhya and Prayagraj pilgrimage for senior citizens</h2>
<p>For a <strong>Kashi Ayodhya Prayagraj tour with senior citizens</strong>, practical arrangements deserve as much attention as the sightseeing list.</p>
<p>Please tell us about walking limitations, difficulty with steps, wheelchair requirements or the need for frequent breaks. This helps us plan suitable hotels, realistic visit times and the final approach to temples and riverfront areas.</p>
<p>Private transport does not always reach the entrance of every temple or ghat. Local movement may involve walking or a rickshaw, and river boarding arrangements vary.</p>
<p>We will discuss these details before confirming the programme so that the family can make informed choices.</p>
<h2>What can change the final tour price?</h2>
<p>The main factors are travel dates, hotel selection, vehicle category, group size and the final route.</p>
<p>Festival travel may need different arrangements from an ordinary week. Extra sightseeing, additional guide services, special rituals or a change in arrival and departure cities can also affect the quotation.</p>
<p>For larger groups, we recalculate the package using a suitable vehicle and the required services. The two-person rate should not simply be multiplied to estimate every group size.</p>
<p>A clear enquiry helps us prepare an accurate proposal. Share your dates, number of guests, arrival and departure details, hotel preferences and any particular temple or ritual requests.</p>
